      "description": "Explanatory text-field palette, padding, and radius; native InputText retains the frame fill during hover and editing. Browser editing does not reproduce native interaction.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" aria-label=\"Output path\" value=\"output/model.ply\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{font:16px \"Spirula UI\",\"Source Sans 3\",sans-serif;background:#25313D;color:#E8EDF2;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;caret-color:#CDE2F5;}.ds-input:hover,.ds-input:active{cursor:text;}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #8CC4F3;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-input::selection{background:rgba(53,109,158,.65);}.ds-input:disabled{opacity:.6;}"
